```

**Issue:**
This assumes the header is exactly `'Bearer <token>'`. If the header is `'bearer <token>'` (lowercase) or `'Bearer  <token>'` (extra space), `replace` will not work correctly. `String.prototype.replace` only replaces the first occurrence and is case-sensitive. This is a common source of bugs.

### Verdict

**Reject.**

